*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* SELECTION-SCREEN
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
"향후 권한 연동하여 User 별 Defalut 값 관리 시 Display 필드로 변경 예정(BUKRS)
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S01.
  PARAMETERS     : P_BUKRS LIKE T001-BUKRS.
  SELECT-OPTIONS : S_WERKS  FOR T001W-WERKS MODIF ID PXX,
                   S_LIFNR  FOR LFM1-LIFNR,
                   S_BUDAT  FOR MKPF-BUDAT  MODIF ID PST NO-EXTENSION.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S02.
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    PARAMETERS : P_PST RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1 DEFAULT 'X'
                                        USER-COMMAND EXE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 6.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R01 FOR FIELD P_PST.
    PARAMETERS : P_HIS RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 30.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R02 FOR FIELD P_HIS.
    PARAMETERS : P_PRD RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 60.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R03 FOR FIELD P_PRD.
  SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF LINE.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK2.
